    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5b74a7d34d0240bdbe6ceba4b0aa34bf",
      "statement": "The __pregel_tasks channel is a reserved internal Topic[Send] that stores Send objects for dynamic node dispatch. Nodes returning Send objects write to this channel; the scheduler consumes them to spawn parallel tasks. This channel is not exposed to user schemas.",
